WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:09.170
Chūka Ichiban

00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:36.350
I can't stay at a place like this.

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:39.680
Sanjie is expelled.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.040
But as far as I'm concerned,

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:43.900
Sanjie is passionate

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:45.230
about cooking.

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:49.280
It's just that he has a tragic past

00:01:49.370 --> 00:01:51.060
that no one else knows.

00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:57.800
Every time I see this scar,

00:01:57.850 --> 00:01:58.710
it reminds me of what happened that day.

00:01:59.220 --> 00:01:59.980
Sanjie,

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:02.250
don't give up your dream of becoming a chef.

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:04.450
Let's have a try, Sanjie.

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:06.310
Let's have a try.

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:07.710
Just like that. The two of us

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:09.610
decided to pose a challenge to

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:11.050
shredded pork with green pepper.

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:17.190
To break the tradition
and conquer Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:02:31.070 --> 00:02:31.910
Can I do it?

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:33.860
But I have been expelled.

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:35.300
It's okay.

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:38.000
As long as you can make delicious
shredded pork with green pepper,

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:39.550
father will definitely forgive you.

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:42.260
It's the only way.

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:43.920
With our passion and love

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:44.670
for cooking,

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:46.230
let's make the shredded pork with green pepper

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:48.410
that people can only find
at Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:49.680
Okay?

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:54.310
Okay, let's try.

00:02:55.530 --> 00:02:56.720
To be honest,

00:02:57.140 --> 00:02:58.140
no other restaurant

00:02:58.190 --> 00:03:00.370
can compare with our restaurant.

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:07.240
It's strange.

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:08.920
I remember I have turned off the light.

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:22.090
Chef Zhou Yu.

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:23.910
Father.

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:26.660
What are you guys doing here?

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:29.830
Sanjie, you have already been expelled.

00:03:30.570 --> 00:03:32.080
Chef Zhou Yu, please!

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:32.870
No matter what,

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:34.650
please give Sanjie another chance!

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.120
We will make the shredded pork with green pepper

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:38.270
that matches the name of Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:39.890
What are you talking about, Mao?

00:03:40.270 --> 00:03:41.800
Our rules are strict.

00:03:42.270 --> 00:03:42.810
A lazy person

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:44.500
won't achieve anything.

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:46.530
I know that Sanjie is no way a lazy person.

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:49.090
Because he is passionate about cooking.

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:50.010
Yeah.

00:03:50.140 --> 00:03:51.730
It's just that you never know it.

00:03:51.810 --> 00:03:53.190
He has reasons.

00:03:57.980 --> 00:03:59.400
Please, Chef Zhou Yu.

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:01.860
I know I made a mistake.

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:02.970
But, Chef Zhou Yu,

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:03.990
please give me another chance.

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:06.650
Let me cook shredded pork with green pepper.

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:09.870
Chef Zhou Yu!

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:11.030
Father!

00:04:11.340 --> 00:04:13.420
No. Rules are rules.

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:16.330
Mao.

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:17.600
If you have problems with

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:18.830
the rules of Yang Spring Restaurant,

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:19.850
you can leave, too.

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:44.550
If you have problems with

00:04:44.600 --> 00:04:45.410
the rules of Yang Spring Restaurant,

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:46.570
you can leave, too.

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:48.330
Father is so heartless.

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:49.660
He is so strict.

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:51.160
Mao.

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:53.720
I don't want you to be punished because of me.

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:55.440
It's not too late.

00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:57.080
You should apologize to Chef Zhou Yu now!

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:00.290
Hey!

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:04.290
Let's open our own restaurant here.

00:05:05.430 --> 00:05:07.210
It's too soon to give up.

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:09.720
Don't forget that we can cook
just with water and fire.

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:11.320
Whether it's a food stand or whatever.

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:12.180
Anyway, let's open our own restaurant,

00:05:12.340 --> 00:05:14.160
and cook delicious
shredded pork with green pepper.

00:05:14.420 --> 00:05:15.440
Once we have customers,

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:16.910
and they like our dish,

00:05:17.260 --> 00:05:19.270
I believe Chef Zhou Yu will definitely forgive us.

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:20.450
It's a good idea.

00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:22.800
Okay, let's start.

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:24.440
Can it be that simple?

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:25.760
Sanjie.

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:28.120
Anyway, let's work together,

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:30.240
and make the best
shredded pork with green pepper.

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:40.000
Great! It's done.

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:44.090
But it's good that you found all these things.

00:05:44.850 --> 00:05:46.390
I searched everywhere for these.

00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:48.520
See? I'm not bad, right?

00:05:49.690 --> 00:05:51.100
You have my respect!

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:53.920
Now let's see what the chefs can do.

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:56.010
Mao. Meili.

00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:56.760
Thank you.

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:58.270
If I fail this time,

00:05:58.650 --> 00:05:59.870
I will give up for sure.

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:01.250
There you go again.

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:03.230
Don't always say passive things.

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:05.550
Sanjie, let's make the
shredded pork with green pepper

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:07.260
that matches the name of Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:08.830
And let's make a lot of money from it!

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:12.580
Okay! Let's do it!

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:19.510
(Crispy) The basic of shredded pork with
green pepper is the crispy feeling.

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:21.260
The crispy feeling.

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:22.190
(Tender)
And the tender meat.

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:24.270
It's not only soft but also chewy.

00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:27.720
So it's important to choose the right way we chop.

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:31.020
First, we chop the bamboo shoots.

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:33.920
Next, we chop the green peppers.

00:06:39.910 --> 00:06:40.750
And then, we chop the meat.

00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:43.110
Chop them into the same size.

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:46.130
It will definitely be good.

00:06:50.940 --> 00:06:53.790
The meat is ready after seasoning.

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:55.330
Now let's give the floor to

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:56.340
our protagonist Sanjie!

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:00.940
Yes!

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:06.140
Let's start with the bamboo shoots.
They are the hardest to cook.

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:07.860
Okay, I'll add enough oil in it.

00:07:07.930 --> 00:07:08.780
Then it's the bamboo shoot shreds.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.640
Shredded meat.

00:07:18.010 --> 00:07:18.860
He is good at it.

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:20.150
The meat can spread instantly

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:21.900
without chopsticks.

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:24.510
Drain the oil while put in the green peppers.

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:25.710
Then put them back into the pot.

00:07:25.930 --> 00:07:27.290
Add seasonings.

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:28.740
Blend quickly to give more flavors.

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:30.810
Good job, Sanjie!

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:32.370
Go! Sanjie!

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:33.650
Wonderful.

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:34.920
They both look so happy.

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:36.690
Mao is in charge of the knife.

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:37.990
Sanjie is in charge of the pot.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:40.190
With their cooperation,

00:07:40.260 --> 00:07:42.310
they will definitely make the best
shredded pork with green pepper!

00:07:47.470 --> 00:07:49.120
It looks good.

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:50.080
Let's have a taste.

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:57.810
Yummy!

00:07:58.280 --> 00:07:59.640
It's a completely different flavor.

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:00.660
It's because

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:02.290
all the ingredients are well-done.

00:08:03.990 --> 00:08:04.900
Yeah!

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:06.170
It's hard to believe that
just changing the way to chop

00:08:06.220 --> 00:08:07.850
can make such a big difference.

00:08:08.440 --> 00:08:10.320
Sanjie is really good at using pot.

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:12.620
Chef Zhou Yu will be convinced.

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:13.170
Hey, Mao.

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:14.240
Have a taste.

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:15.930
Let me have a taste.

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:22.230
So? Is it good?

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:25.320
What's wrong?

00:08:26.930 --> 00:08:27.410
Mao.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:30.060
I realize that

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:32.120
we forgot something important.

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:34.550
Actually the shredded pork with
green pepper is a failure.

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:37.300
What do you mean, Mao?

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:40.610
It has a fatal weakness.

00:08:40.840 --> 00:08:42.870
It won't please Chef Zhou Yu.

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:44.970
What's wrong with it?

00:08:45.260 --> 00:08:46.530
We did a good job for sure.

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:49.740
It has the flavor we need.

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:50.730
It's the shredded pork with green pepper

00:08:50.780 --> 00:08:51.830
that presents the original flavor.

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:55.030
But that is the flaw.

00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:57.740
(Yang Spring Restaurant)

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:00.300
You are right.

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:01.840
Tell me. What's wrong with

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:02.900
this shredded pork with green pepper?

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:05.050
It's really delicious.

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:07.030
The shredded pork with green pepper of
Yang Spring Restaurant

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:09.060
can't just be delicious.

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:12.660
We should try again.

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:45.050
My gosh. Day is breaking.

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:49.210
Is there any other way?

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:54.520
I think these are

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:55.970
all delicious.

00:09:56.440 --> 00:09:58.320
What more do you want?

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:00.930
What are you thinking?

00:10:01.310 --> 00:10:02.670
What shredded pork with green pepper

00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:05.600
can match the name of Yang Spring Restaurant?

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:08.350
My gosh!

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:16.550
What is this? It's disgusting.

00:10:16.600 --> 00:10:18.620
It's so sticky.

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:20.010
Yes!

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:20.880
What happened, Mao?

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:22.150
I found it!

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:22.800
What is it?

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:23.600
Look!

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:29.410
It's noon.

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:30.660
I'm so hungry!

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:35.170
Where does this stand come from?

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:37.400
It only sells shredded pork with green pepper.

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:38.580
It looks good.

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:39.550
Let's have a taste.

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:40.280
Welcome!

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:42.320
Isn't this Meili?

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:44.310
What are you doing here?

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:45.080
Don't ask.

00:10:45.110 --> 00:10:45.940
I'm here for some reason.

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:48.550
Please. You are our first customers.

00:10:48.690 --> 00:10:50.660
Are you letting us eat

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:52.240
the shredded pork with green pepper like yesterday?

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:53.770
If you are, I'll pass.

00:10:53.870 --> 00:10:54.910
Don't worry.

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:55.750
Have a taste.

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:57.360
If you don't like it, you don't need to pay.

00:10:57.830 --> 00:10:58.520
You said it.

00:10:58.640 --> 00:10:59.800
We'll have shredded pork with green pepper for two.

00:10:59.950 --> 00:11:01.220
Me too.

00:11:01.330 --> 00:11:02.220
Thank you!

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:04.410
Shredded pork with green pepper for four!

00:11:04.780 --> 00:11:05.650
Okay!

00:11:06.440 --> 00:11:07.290
Let's do it, Mao!

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:08.920
Yes, Sanjie!

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:36.880
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:40.060
Let's have a taste.

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:01.010
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:17.440
It's so good!

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:19.190
Sanjie, look!

00:12:20.770 --> 00:12:22.570
Yeah!

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:37.040
Mao, chop quickly.

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:38.170
Time is running out.

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:43.940
Shredded pork with green pepper for seven!

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:45.520
Got it!

00:12:49.020 --> 00:12:50.130
Five more, please!

00:12:50.570 --> 00:12:51.240
Okay!

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:58.180
One more, please!

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:15.710
What happened today?

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:17.840
Normally, we would have a full house now.

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:18.550
Chef Zhou Yu!

00:13:18.710 --> 00:13:19.600
What's wrong?

00:13:20.220 --> 00:13:22.720
People are all at the food stand in the square.

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:23.260
What?

00:13:24.340 --> 00:13:26.180
I heard their shredded pork with green pepper is red!

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:27.660
When is our turn?

00:13:27.710 --> 00:13:28.720
We have been waiting for too long.

00:13:29.460 --> 00:13:30.450
Excuse me.

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:31.070
Sorry.

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:32.250
Don't cut the line!

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:34.070
Chef Zhou Yu.

00:13:35.490 --> 00:13:36.870
We have an empty spot now.

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:37.510
Please sit here.

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:41.360
Meili?

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:43.040
Mao? Sanjie?

00:13:43.660 --> 00:13:45.240
What are you doing here?

00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:54.830
Let us have a taste of

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:56.390
your shredded pork with green pepper.

00:13:57.540 --> 00:13:58.600
Okay!

00:13:59.000 --> 00:13:59.880
Mao! Sanjie!

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:01.720
Shredded pork with green pepper for three!

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:03.430
Okay!

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:04.270
Sanjie!

00:14:21.370 --> 00:14:22.250
Sanjie!

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:24.470
Let's do it!

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:48.540
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:51.370
Please try our shredded pork with green pepper.

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:56.010
Why is it red?

00:14:56.140 --> 00:14:57.720
Will it be good?

00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:22.240
I've never had such delicious food before!

00:15:25.010 --> 00:15:27.990
It has a very fresh flavor.

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:29.730
And the sweetness

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:31.880
makes it more outstanding.

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:33.840
The mystery flavor is from...

00:15:43.050 --> 00:15:43.790
I see.

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:45.560
It's so good!

00:15:46.230 --> 00:15:47.640
How can they make it so good?

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:48.820
Can't you see now?

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:51.150
Look at the things on the ground.

00:15:51.770 --> 00:15:54.380
Aren't those persimmon seeds?

00:15:56.490 --> 00:15:57.300
Yeah, I see.

00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:59.460
You used persimmons.

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:02.360
Yes. We used the overripe persimmons

00:16:02.400 --> 00:16:03.250
that no one wanted

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:04.480
from the tree.

00:16:05.010 --> 00:16:05.870
I see.

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:07.380
That's why it's red.

00:16:07.510 --> 00:16:09.370
How did you do it?

00:16:09.920 --> 00:16:11.440
Actually the persimmons that are overripe

00:16:11.520 --> 00:16:13.760
and about to fall down from the tree

00:16:13.920 --> 00:16:15.850
are the sweetest.

00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:18.360
I mashed the persimmons,

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:19.900
and substituted it for sugar.

00:16:20.030 --> 00:16:21.660
Then I added seasonings including

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:24.890
sauce, soy sauce and potato starch,

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:27.720
which could add more flavors into it,

00:16:27.810 --> 00:16:30.330
and could bring out the best taste.

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:33.290
It turns out the unique flavor is from persimmons.

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:36.740
The sweetness of overripe persimmons

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:38.460
matches with the flavor of vegetable.

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:40.310
It makes the shredded pork with green pepper

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:41.940
crispier and tenderer.

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:44.050
So the shredded pork with green pepper becomes perfect.

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:49.470
Father, the customers like it too.

00:16:50.950 --> 00:16:52.450
Chef Zhou Yu, please reconsider

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:54.800
the decision to expel Sanjie.

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:04.670
There is no better ingredient than the right season.

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:06.280
Right, Chef Zhou Yu?

00:17:10.310 --> 00:17:11.460
Chef Ruoh.

00:17:11.910 --> 00:17:15.160
As long as they are used in right ways,

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:16.780
even though the overripe persimmons

00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:18.900
can produce good results.

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:21.880
So as chefs.

00:17:22.460 --> 00:17:24.130
The two young boys

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:25.590
could think of a new flavor

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:27.200
within just one night.

00:17:27.930 --> 00:17:29.430
Maybe they are on their way

00:17:29.510 --> 00:17:32.690
to become successful chefs.

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:35.410
It's your call.

00:17:35.810 --> 00:17:38.730
Okay. Sanjie. Mao.

00:17:38.980 --> 00:17:39.410
Yes!

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:40.990
Let me ask you.

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:44.310
What's the tradition of Yang spring Restaurant?

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:45.570
It is...

00:17:47.350 --> 00:17:49.420
It is to break the traditional ways.

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:50.840
Very good.

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:52.880
Yang Spring Restaurant

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:53.970
never has a fixed flavor.

00:17:54.410 --> 00:17:56.240
We must innovate

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:58.780
to break the traditional flavors.

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:00.200
This is our tradition.

00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:02.420
That's why this shredded pork with green pepper

00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:03.500
represents

00:18:03.550 --> 00:18:05.810
the true spirit of Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:09.120
Yeah. This is what Mao meant

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:10.280
by shredded pork with green pepper of

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:11.450
Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:12.890
Okay. Let me break

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:14.760
a tradition, too.

00:18:15.420 --> 00:18:16.680
Chef Zhou Yu.

00:18:17.230 --> 00:18:19.750
Yes! The quota system

00:18:19.860 --> 00:18:21.310
is now officially abolished.

00:18:23.670 --> 00:18:26.300
Sanjie, I take back the decision to expel you.

00:18:26.550 --> 00:18:27.850
You can go back to the kitchen now.

00:18:29.050 --> 00:18:29.520
Yes!

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:30.640
Yeah!

00:18:30.760 --> 00:18:32.160
Sanjie, it's great!

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:33.650
Congratulations, Sanjie.

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:35.400
Thank you!

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:49.820
Sanjie!

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:51.110
It's wonderful!

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:53.690
Congratulations, Sanjie!

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:56.600
Sanjie, let's be partners.

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:57.540
I'm in charge of the knife.

00:18:57.640 --> 00:18:59.790
You are in charge of the pot.

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:02.410
Okay. Let's do this.

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:04.990
We are the best duo of Yang Spring Restaurant!

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:05.790
Right?

00:19:06.280 --> 00:19:06.960
Yeah!

00:19:07.350 --> 00:19:08.450
You guys work together

00:19:08.550 --> 00:19:10.920
to make Yang Spring Restaurant better
and more famous.

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:12.040
Please!

00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:13.500
You are acting like a big sister again.

00:19:41.900 --> 00:19:42.580
Father.

00:19:54.160 --> 00:19:54.790
I did it!

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:56.400
I did it!

00:19:56.930 --> 00:19:58.200
Father, I can make moon halo!

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:04.810
Sanjie.

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:08.230
Morning. Let's buy vegetable.

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:15.480
Mao.

00:20:15.840 --> 00:20:17.140
I'm so glad that I met you.

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:18.130
When I was making

00:20:18.180 --> 00:20:19.750
shredded pork with green pepper with you,

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:21.940
the way I felt when I

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:23.330
held the pot in my hand

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:25.730
made me realize the fun of cooking.

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:28.260
Now I have the courage to start over.

00:20:29.090 --> 00:20:31.360
So I decide to leave.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:32.560
How could he do that?

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:33.980
We just met each other.

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:40.070
People here are so nice to me.

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:42.330
If I stayed here,

00:20:42.710 --> 00:20:44.270
I would never have the courage to start over.

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:54.360
I will go back to Shanghai to stay with my father.

00:20:54.490 --> 00:20:55.410
I will learn from the strictest teacher
in the whole country,

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:58.330
no, in the whole world,

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:00.580
my father.

00:21:00.910 --> 00:21:02.510
I will start from zero again

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:03.600
while I still have courage.

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:05.430
The pot and knife are my gifts for you.

00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:06.590
Just see it as thank you gifts.

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:07.950
Mao, keep going!

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:11.810
Sanjie! Sanjie!

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:16.200
Mao!

00:21:17.550 --> 00:21:19.260
Sanjie!

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:20.750
Mao!

00:21:22.450 --> 00:21:24.250
Sanjie, I will keep going!

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:26.420
I will work hard

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:27.860
to become a top chef.

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:29.410
Mao!

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:30.720
I believe

00:21:30.960 --> 00:21:32.890
you will definitely become a top chef!

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:34.440
Keep going!

00:21:34.710 --> 00:21:36.690
I hope we can meet again!

00:21:36.990 --> 00:21:38.230
Mao!

00:21:38.660 --> 00:21:40.410
Sanjie!

00:23:14.890 --> 00:23:18.160
Preview of the next episode

00:23:18.160 --> 00:23:20.316
The famous Guangzhou Dumpling Competition

00:23:20.316 --> 00:23:23.527
When I attended the competition in place of Zhou Yu,

00:23:23.527 --> 00:23:27.322
I confronted a very strong opponent
who spat fire from his mouth and cooked.

00:23:27.364 --> 00:23:29.490
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.532 --> 00:23:31.951
Flame Chefs: The Dumpling Brothers

00:23:32.035 --> 00:23:33.619
It will definitely be interesting!
